
comment ~/.ssh/config
#ServerAliveInterval 120
#ControlPersist 2h
#ControlMaster auto
#ControlPath ~/.ssh/master-%r@%h:%p

disable ControlMaster for remote nologin user, otherwise it will login then disconnect immediatly

when config like

Host moon
    HostName moon
    User root
    PreferredAuthentications publickey
    Port 0
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa

DO NOT CONFIG ControlMaster


or

config ControlMaster, do not config Host moon
------------------------------
~/.ssh/config
Host *
ControlPersist yes
ControlMaster auto
ControlPath ~/.ssh/master-%r@%h:%p

# this will generate a socket file in ~/.ssh/master-user@remote:port

then run "ssh -p 22 -N root@moon"
now ssh again will be very fast
and vim scp://root@moon:22/a.hs will be very fast

if there're file exist, disable multiple, just delete .ssh/ssh-socket-file
may set ControlPersist 2h will good
